{"c":[{"id":"ccba801a8aa9c8ea","sum":"D2-02: Router 1 answers within ~0.05 of its 0.5 floor flip between corpus runs; diff per moment before crediting a recall move. B27: a failed fill reaches the user only via Helper.fillFailed (planner/says.ts fillSays); ids go to warn.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T031924Z-459c6ef9ec89ae5d","text":"D2-02: Router 1 answers within ~0.05 of its 0.5 floor flip between live corpus runs (m02 0.52/0.49, m09 0.45/0.51); diff runs per moment before crediting a code change with a recall move.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T032639Z-5905894b0fafbfcc","text":"B27: a failed fill reaches the user only through Helper.fillFailed (planner/says.ts fillSays); its window and field ids go to warn. Early exits that called this.error published ids until afadd34.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"91fb33162eeab888","sum":"B28: after a fixture page navigates, wait for site.waitForLoad before the next site.command; accept.ts cannot run executor.run (watchInput gets noWindow), so test page-link VerbResults there and the executor with test/fake-app.ts.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T044215Z-74ca06dede7d18b3","text":"B28: after a fixture page navigates away, wait for site.waitForLoad of the landed page before the next site.command, or the command goes to the departing page's long poll and times out.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T044215Z-8ef7ae66324e8796","text":"B28: accept.ts cannot run executor.run: it first asks the native reader for watchInput and gets noWindow; check page-link VerbResults in accept and the executor with test/fake-app.ts knobs.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
